(text "ENGINE I/O CARD (dedicated keyed slot, card type 0x0001)\nKey: engine-only coding notch in the card edge + matching rib in the engine\nslot guide; LV cards have the LV notch. ID EEPROM type check too.\nFuel/crank/glow drivers are fed ONLY from VBAT_ESTOP (E-stop cut is external,\nupstream of J23 on the mainboard).\nFUEL_EN/CRANK_EN/GLOW_EN arrive already gated by WD_OK on the mainboard\n(U38-U40). Missing card = no drive = engine stops.\nContacts (2 A each, 50 % derate): VBAT_ESTOP 12 (12 A >= 10 A F2 fuse);\nFUEL_OUT 8 and CRANK_OUT 8 (8 A >= 6.14 A max short-circuit trip).\nGlow driver (baseline U47) VS moved VBAT_P -> VBAT_ESTOP (Nov 23 decision):\nE-stop now also cuts glow.\nSlot pinout table: cards/engine/engine_slot_pinout.csv. b-row signals are GND\nguards. ENG_PRESENT_N (c31) tied to GND on the card, read on the mainboard\n0x22 P10.\nPass 1 M1: 100 nF / 100 V at the glow driver VS + 2.2 uF / 100 V bulk on\nVBAT_ESTOP (mainboard C205-C219 removed). Pass 3 MAJ-D: 100 nF / 100 V on the\nfuel / crank TPS48100 SRC (FUEL_OUT, CRANK_OUT)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 347.98 302.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d23a70d9-1b9e-4885-907c-f3afcc45542d"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
(embedded_fonts no))
